      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but i really don't have time to wait for a doctors appointment right now. i just mean like, i'm not getting drunk or anything, it's just one small glass. it's not like i'm drinking a bottle. is it really going to be that big of a deal for just one glass? it seems like people do it all the time.",
